### Bug Category

Missing test case *(Incorrect/Inefficient Code getting accepted because of missing test cases)*

### Bug Description

An accepted solution gets TLE on the following testcase:
[1.txt](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18209635/1.txt)


### Language Used for Code

C++

### Code used for Submit/Run operation

```bash
class Solution {
public:
    int longestConsecutive(vector<int>& nums) {
        unordered_set<int> nums_set;
        for(const int& num : nums) nums_set.insert(num);  //用哈希表存储所有数据，方便后续查找。
        
        int ans = 0;

        for(const int& num : nums) {
            if(!nums_set.count(num - 1)) {               //如果num-1不存在说明可以跳过，具体思路可以看题解，这里写不开TT
                int cur_num = num, cur_len = 1;
                while(nums_set.count(cur_num + 1)) {
                    cur_num ++;
                    cur_len ++;
                }
                ans = max(ans, cur_len);
            }
        }
        return ans;
    }
};
```


### Expected behavior

The code gets TLE.

